 WordCount_test;body;r
 body←⎕NS ⍬ ⋄ body.text←'The cat and the hat and THE bat' ⋄ body.top←2
 r←WordCount body
 2 ExpectEq≢r
 ('the' 3)ExpectEq r[1].(word count)    ⍝ case-insensitive
 ('and' 2)ExpectEq r[2].(word count)
 body.text←'' ⋄ ⍬ ExpectEq WordCount body
 ExpectTrue 0<≢(WordCount 1 2).error     ⍝ not an object → error message
